# Timestamped backups of the above. The bare names are exact-match patterns,
# so `.env.sepolia.bak-20260820-113344` was NOT ignored and a `git add -A`
# would have staged seven private keys. Does not match `.env.sepolia.example`,
# which is tracked on purpose.
.env.bak*
.env.sepolia.bak*
